    ["<Assistant_Title1>【明于绿夜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得明于绿夜套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Bright in Green Night] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Pool Outfit \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain the Bright in Green Night set; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（差不多到约定的时间了……去湖边找安迪汇合吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It's almost time for the appointment... Let's go to the Lakeside to meet Andy.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（放下工具，想了想）</> 有一块怀表，表盖内侧刻了字，是两个人的名字和一个日期。"] = "<P_Heart>(Puts down tools, thinks for a moment)</> There was a pocket watch with words engraved on the inside of the cover: two names and a date.",
